  <diagram id="09-sequence-review" name="Tuần tự review">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="2" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;image=data:image/svg+xml;base64,;sourcePath=../09-sequence-review.mmd;sourceFormat=mermaid;sourceHash=6bf5bb36676496e31871a5823f66fd039b19075c5ac68e614f6da3d6d05626b1;description=Tuần tự review" vertex="1" parent="1" sourcePath="../09-sequence-review.mmd" sourceFormat="mermaid" sourceHash="6bf5bb36676496e31871a5823f66fd039b19075c5ac68e614f6da3d6d05626b1" description="Tuần tự review">
          <mxGeometry x="40.0" y="40.0" width="1120.0" height="750.67" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="40.0" y="40.0" width="1120.0" height="750.67" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" value="&amp;lt;pre&amp;gt;%%{init: {&amp;#x27;theme&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;base&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;themeVariables&amp;#x27;: {&amp;#x27;primaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#EDF6F0&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;primaryTextColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#17324D&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;primaryBorderColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#315C7D&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;lineColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#526575&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;secondaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#F7F3E8&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;tertiaryColor&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;#FFFFFF&amp;#x27;, &amp;#x27;fontSize&amp;#x27;: &amp;#x27;12px&amp;#x27;}}}%%&#10;sequenceDiagram&#10;    autonumber&#10;    actor User as Người dùng&#10;    participant UI as Giao diện Flutter&#10;    participant VM as WorkspaceViewModel&#10;    participant Repo as ReviewRepository&#10;    participant API as ReviewApi&#10;    participant Http as ApiService&#10;    participant Proxy as FastAPI&#10;    participant Cache as Review cache&#10;    participant Limit as RateLimiter&#10;    participant Provider as Gemini provider&#10;    participant Verify as QuoteVerifier&#10;    participant Store as SessionStore&#10;&#10;    User-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UI: Chọn unit và bấm Review&#10;    UI-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: runReview()&#10;    VM-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: Lấy unit đã chọn, kẹp tối đa 60&#10;    VM-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: run(filteredDocument, concurrency=4, pdfBytes?, imageReviewEnabled?)&#10;    activate Repo&#10;    Repo-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: Kẹp concurrency 1..8, lấy tối đa 60 unit&#10;    Repo-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: Nếu PDF tươi + online: lập kế hoạch ảnh, ngân sách 12 trang&#10;    Repo-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: Tạo tối đa concurrency worker&#10;    loop Mỗi worker lấy unit tiếp theo&#10;        Repo-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;API: review(unit, text, section, page, image?)&#10;        API-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Http: POST /review&#10;        Http-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: request + X-App-Token + X-User-Id&#10;        Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Cache: lookup(key đầy đủ)&#10;        alt cache hit&#10;            Cache--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: ReviewResult&#10;            Proxy--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Http: result&#10;        else cache miss&#10;            Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Limit: check(user, 50/ngày)&#10;            alt quota đã hết&#10;                Limit--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: 429 + Retry-After&#10;                Proxy--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Http: 429&#10;                Http--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;API: ApiException&#10;                API--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: kết thúc toàn run&#10;            else được phép&#10;                Limit--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: allowed&#10;                Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Provider: generate_json(review prompt + optional image)&#10;                Provider--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: JSON có cấu trúc&#10;                Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Verify: review_issues(quote, source, threshold=0.92)&#10;                Verify--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Proxy: giữ quote hợp lệ, đếm quote bị loại&#10;                Proxy-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Cache: put(key đầy đủ, ReviewResult)&#10;                Proxy--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Http: ReviewResult&#10;            end&#10;        end&#10;        Http--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;API: ReviewResult&#10;        API--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: result hoặc lỗi&#10;        Repo-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: Lỗi ảnh có thể retry text-only, lỗi thường ghi theo unit&#10;    end&#10;    Repo-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repo: Tổng hợp results + failures + coverage&#10;    Repo--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: ReviewProgress: parsing/reviewing/verifying&#10;    Repo--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: ReviewRun: done/cancelled/failed&#10;    VM-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: Cập nhật trạng thái unit&#10;    VM-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Store: saveSnapshot/saveSession&#10;    Store--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;VM: đã lưu&#10;    VM--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UI: tiến độ/kết quả&#10;    deactivate Repo&#10;&#10;    Note over Repo,Proxy: Review cache được tra trước RateLimiter, cache hit không tốn quota.&#10;    Note over API,Provider: ApiService retry lỗi transient tối đa 3 chuyến HTTP/lời gọi, repository tối đa 3 attempt/unit.&#10;    Note over Proxy,Verify: QuoteVerifier chỉ áp dụng review/ask, không áp dụng diagram audit.&#10;&amp;lt;/pre&amp;gt;" style="text;html=1;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;visible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="10" height="10" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="40" y="40" width="10" height="10" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>